Sounds like you might be in explore mode or wizard mode... You should
really try to play the game through without these.  The game isn't
really meant to be played with a free wand of wishing at the start. 
You'll learn a lot faster about how to survive.
 
Both magic resistance and reflection are useful, and your goal should
be to obtain both.  Each of them protects against certain attacks.
 
As other people said, Valkyries are pretty easy.  I consider them the
easiest class for beginners to win with.  You should continue to work
on Valkyries until you win with one, or at least until you get past
the quest and the castle level.

